      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "summary",
          "text": "An update for pcs is now available for Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9.4 Update Services for SAP Solutions.\n\nRed Hat Product Security has rated this update as having a security impact of Important. A Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) base score, which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVE link(s) in the References section.",
          "title": "Topic"
        },
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "The pcs packages provide a command-line configuration system for the Pacemaker and Corosync utilities.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* lodash: lodash: Arbitrary code execution via untrusted input in template imports (CVE-2026-4800)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
          "title": "Details"
        },
